  "description": "Established in 1977 and based in Ticino, Switzerland, PAMP rapidly became the world's leading bullion brand with dominant positions in major precious metals markets worldwide. PAMP Suisse is renowned for their Fortuna bars, which are arguably the most widely traded gold bars in the world, featuring .9999 pure gold and approval from the London Bullion Market Association. Operating one of Switzerland's largest precious metals refineries, PAMP manufactures gold bars to some of the highest standards in the industry, combining exceptional craftsmanship with artistic design elements that make their products highly coveted by investors and collectors alike.",
  "canonical": "https://bulliontradingllc.com/mints/pamp/",
